    "enUS": {
      "description": "Listen up. I'm going to walk out that door behind you. Yer gonna wait until I'm good and gone, and then yer gonna meet me behind the graveyard outside o' town. Ensure yer not followed.",
      "dialogue": {
        "0e7292b5086ab37077fe": "So that's the score, $c. I need ye to sneak into that tower and find out what ye can. How 'bout it?"
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
